===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A defensive or deflective action; an act of parrying.
# {{lb|en|fencing}} A simple defensive action designed to deflect an attack, performed with the [[forte]] of the blade.
# {{lb|en|combat sports and martial arts}} A defensive move intended to change the direction of an incoming strike to make it miss its intended target, rather than block and absorb it; and typically performed with an open hand in a downward or sideways slapping motion.

